Circle Reveal uses the unmodified Niri open and close shader functions by liixini:
https://github.com/liixini/shaders/tree/238e7c70e317bb0ca0b0366cf0851b8de3ddc969/circle

The transition was originally derived from circleopen.glsl by gre in
gl-transitions (MIT). OmaDecor contributors wrote the HWS compatibility
wrapper and pack metadata. The original shader files remain in Niri format.

The illustrative preview GIF was generated by OmaDecor contributors from the
Circle shader's MIT-licensed mask on a synthetic window. It is not a capture
of a user application or a guarantee of identical compositor rendering.
